              <span class="icon tenth"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">10&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Six Months Elite
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>This grants you a variety of in-game benefits for six months!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon first"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">10&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Inner Wear Costume Bundle
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Contains an Inner Wear costume bundle for your choice of class, 1 Elite Status Voucher (30-Day), 11 Mysterious Keys, 5 Lucky Pet Potlucks, 10 Stylish Accent Boxes, and 7 Enigmatic Emblem Boxes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </li>

      <li data-label="15">
        <img src="http://download.enmasse.com/store/<%= @game %>/2018-gifting/Rewards/Reward_15.jpg" alt="Gifting Reward" />

         <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon fifteenth"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">15&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Glitterclaw dragon mount (account-bound), Cheery Winter Scarf, Glowing Skull Santa Hat
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Who needs reindeer, when you can ride a dragon right through the heart of the season?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon fifteenth"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">15&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Tradeable Iridescent Phase Wings 3-Star Package
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Iridescent Phase Wings, just like Irena’s!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon fifteenth"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">15&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Inner Wear and Icicle Weapon Skin Bundle
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Contains an Inner Wear costume bundle for your choice of class, an Icicle Weapon Skin for your choice of class, 1 Elite Status Voucher (30-Day), 15 Mysterious Keys, 6 Lucky Pet Potlucks, 12 Stylish Accent Boxes, and 12 Enigmatic Emblem Boxes.</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </li>

      <li data-label="20">
        <img src="http://download.enmasse.com/store/<%= @game %>/2018-gifting/Rewards/Reward_20.jpg" alt="Gifting Reward" />

        <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon twenty"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">20&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Elite Status Game Time (366 days), Spirit of the Season title (delivered via token), Snowflake Flurry
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Send 20 gifts and you get elite status for a year, plus a title to identify you as a generous gift-giver!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon twenty"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">20&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Tradeable Mini Zenith Authority Wings
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Send 20 gifts and you can have a pair of Mini Zenith Authority Wings. This is currently the only way to obtain these.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
          <div class="carousel_about">
            <div class="heading">
              <span class="icon twenty"></span>
              <h3>
                <span class="label">20&mdash;Box Reward:</span> 
                Xanadu Costume Bundle
              </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="copy">
              <p>Contains a Xanadu costume bundle for your choice of class, an Inner Wear costume bundle for your choice of class, an Icicle Weapon Skin for your choice of class, 2 Elite Status Voucher (30-Day), 20 Mysterious Keys, 8 Lucky Pet Potlucks, 15 Stylish Accent Boxes, and 12 Enigmatic Emblem Boxes.</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </li>
    </ul>
  <% end %>


  <% if (@my_gifts[:error]) %>
  <%# elsif (@my_gifts["received_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["received_gifts"].select{|q| q["opened_by"].nil?}.length < 1) && (@my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].empty?) %>
  <% else %>
    <article class="twelve columns buy-more">
      <div class="copy-class">
        <h3>Your Gifting Progress</h3>
        <p>The meter below tracks how many gifts you've sent so far during this season. The rewards you earn will just keep getting bigger and better the more you give.</p>
      </div>
      <ul id="gifts_tracker">
        <li class="<%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 1 %>" >1</li>
        <li class="<%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 5 %>">5</li>
        <li class="<%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 10 %>">10</li>
        <li class="<%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 15 %>">15</li>
        <li class="<%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 20 %>">20</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="purchased<%= ' whale' if (!@game_accounts.nil? && !@my_gifts.nil? && @my_gifts.key?("sent_count") && @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i > 19) %>">
      <% if @game_accounts.nil? || @my_gifts.nil? %>
        <div class="bar"><span id="fill-0"></span></div>
      <% else %>
        <div class="bar">
          <% if @my_gifts["sent_count"] != nil && @my_gifts["sent_count"] > 0 %>
            <span class="left-section"></span>
            <span id="fill-<%= (@my_gifts["sent_count"] < 20) ? @my_gifts["sent_count"] : '20' %>"></span>
            <span id="countingplate-<%= (@my_gifts["sent_count"] < 20) ? @my_gifts["sent_count"] : '20' %>"></span>
            <span class="right-section"></span>
          <% else %>
            <span id="fill-0"></span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      <% end %>

        <div class="markers">
          <span class="marker-1 <%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 1 %>"></span>
          <span class="marker-2"></span>
          <span class="marker-3"></span>
          <span class="marker-4"></span>
          <span class="marker-5 <%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 5 %>"></span>
          <span class="marker-6"></span>
          <span class="marker-7"></span>
          <span class="marker-8"></span>
          <span class="marker-9"></span>
          <span class="marker-10 <%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 10 %>"></span>
          <span class="marker-11"></span>
          <span class="marker-12"></span>
          <span class="marker-13"></span>
          <span class="marker-14"></span>
          <span class="marker-15 <%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 15 %>"></span>
          <span class="marker-16"></span>
          <span class="marker-17"></span>
          <span class="marker-18"></span>
          <span class="marker-19"></span>
          <span class="marker-20 <%= 'active' if @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i >= 20 %>"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </article>
  <% end %>

  <% if @holiday == 'anniversary' %>
  <p>Some restrictions apply. Please reference the <a href="http://support.enmasse.com/<%= @game %>/<%= @game %>-5th-anniversary-celebration-of-giving">Fifth Anniversary—Celebration of Giving FAQ</a> for more details and a full list of prizes.</p>
  <%# else %>
  <!--<p>Some restrictions apply. Please reference the <a href="http://support.enmasse.com/<%= @game %>/2016-holiday-gifting-event">Gifting FAQ</a> for more details and a full list of prizes.</p>-->
  <% end %>

  <% if (@game_accounts.nil? || @game_accounts.empty? || @didlogout) %>
    <p class="text-align-center">You must sign in to see your gifts.</p>
    <div class="register">
        <%= erb :"shared/login-form" %>
    </div>
  <% elsif !@game_accounts.empty? %>
    <div class="title-bar-dark" id="tabs"><a href="#inventory" class="active"><span>Gift Box Inventory</span></a><a href="#history"><span>Gift Box History</span></a></div>

    <!-- new section for gift boxes layout -->
    

    
    <!-- end of new section -->

    <section id="inventory">
      <% if (@my_gifts[:error]) %>

        <% if @holiday === "wintera" %>
          <div class="gift-card empty">
            <span class="gc_icon"></span>
            <p>Whoops! Looks like you have received no gift boxes yet. But you could still buy a 
              <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
                <a href="/tera">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
                <a href="/closers/items">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
                <a href="/kritika/items">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'ava' %>
                <a href="https://ava-shop.enmasse.com">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
            now or check back here after a friend has given you one.</p>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <article class="twelve columns">
            <div class="four columns">
              <div class="gift-card empty"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="eight columns last">
              <% if @holiday =='anniversary' %>
                <p>You have not yet received a gift. Purchase a <a href="http://store.enmasse.com/<%= @game %>#wide_body">Fifth Anniversary gift box</a> for a friend—or for yourself!—and check back here to see if they've sent you one in return.</p>
              <% else %>
                <p>Cupid's bowstring seem to have gotten tangled. He’ll be back on track soon!</p>
              <% end  %>
            </div>
          </article>
        <% end %>

     <!-- <%# elsif (@my_gifts["received_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["received_gifts"].select{|q| q["opened_by"].nil?}.length < 1) && (@my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].empty?) %>

        <%# if @holiday == "wintera" %>
        the inventroy else section
          <div class="gift-card empty">
            <span class="gc_icon"></span>
            <p>Whoops! Looks like you have received no gift boxes yet. But you could still buy a <a href="https://store.enmasse.com/<%= @game %>/items/goldengiftbox2016">gift box</a> now or check back here after a friend has given you one.</p>
          </div>
        <%# else %>
          <article class="twelve columns">
            <div class="four columns">
              <div class="gift-card empty"><span class="gc_icon"></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="eight columns last">
              <%# if @holiday === "vday" %>
                <p>You have no gift boxes. Purchase a <a href="/<%= @game %>/item/blackbox/black-velvet-party-box">Black Velvet party box</a> or <a href="/<%= @game %>/item/whitebox/white-satin-party-box">White Satin party box</a> for a friend—or for yourself!—and check back here to see if they’ve returned your affection.</p>
              <%# else %>
                <p>Received gifts appear here after you open them in your Gift Box Inventory.</p>
              <%# end  %>
            </div>
          </article>
        <%# end %>-->

      <% else %>

        <div class="box_section"><h4>&ndash; Unopened gift boxes you've received [<%= @my_gifts["received_gifts"].select{|q| q["opened_by"].nil?}.length %>] &ndash;</h4></div>

        <% if (@my_gifts["received_gifts"].length < 1) %>
        <%# if (@my_gifts["received_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["received_gifts"].select{|q| q["opened_by"].nil?}.length < 1) && (@my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].empty?) %>
          <div class="gift-card empty">
            <span class="gc_icon"></span>
            <p>Whoops! It looks like you haven’t received any gift boxes yet. Buy a
              <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
                <a href="/tera">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
                <a href="/closers/items">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
                <a href="/kritika/items">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
              <% if @game.downcase == 'ava' %>
                <a href="https://ava-shop.enmasse.com">gift box</a>
              <% end %>
            to populate your gift inventory or check back here throughout the promotion to see if you received one from a friend.</p>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <% @my_gifts["received_gifts"].each do | gift | %>
            <% next if gift["opened_by"] %>

            <!-- unopened received -->
            <article class="gift_block" id="gift-<%= gift['id'] %>">
              <div class="golden_gift_icon">
                <img src="<%= img_url('gifting/wintera/gift-bg-small.png') %>" class="small_icon" alt="golden gift box" />
                <span class="gc_icon"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="gg_about">
                <span class="detail_label">From:</span>
                <span class="details name"><%= gift["sender_name"] %></span>
                <span class="detail_label">Message:</span>
                <span class="details"><%= gift['message'] %></span>
                <div class="colorbtn claim-gift">
                  <a href="#" class="colorbtn" data-gift-id="<%= gift['id'] %>" data-msg="<%= gift['message'] %>" data-sender="<%= gift['sender_name'] %>" data-recipient="<%= gift['recipient_name'] %>" data-campaign="<%= gift['promotion_id'] %>">Open</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>

        <div class="box_section"><h4>&ndash; Gift boxes you've bought, but not sent [<%= @my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].length %>] &ndash;</h4></div>

        <% @my_gifts["unsent_gifts"].each do | gift | %> 
          <!--bought, not sent -->
          <article class="gift_block" id="gift-<%= gift['id'] %>">
            <div class="golden_gift_icon">
              <img src="<%= img_url('gifting/wintera/gift-bg-small.png') %>" class="small_icon" alt="golden gift box" />
              <span class="gc_icon"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="gg_about">
              <span class="detail_label">From:</span>
              <span class="details name">You</span>
              <span class="detail_label">Message:</span>
              <span class="details">To send a gift to a friend, you’ll need the email address associated with their En Masse account or their character name and server name.<br />-or-<br />You could always keep this gift for yourself and open it to see what’s inside.</span>
              <div class="colorbtn send-gift">
                <a href="/" class="colorbtn" data-gift-id="<%= gift['id'] %>">Send It</a>
              </div>
              <div class="colorbtn claim-gift">
                <a href="/" class="colorbtn" data-gift-id="<%= gift['id'] %>" data-msg="<%= gift['message'] %>" data-sender="<%= gift['sender_name'] %>" data-recipient="<%= gift['recipient_name'] %>" data-campaign="<%= gift['promotion_id'] %>">Open It</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        <% end %>


      <% end %>
    </section>

    <section id="history">
      <% if !@my_gifts["received_gifts"].nil? && @my_gifts["received_gifts"].length %>
      <div class="box_section"><h4>&ndash; Opened gift boxes you've received [<%= @my_gifts["received_gifts"].length %>] &ndash;</h4></div>
      <% end %>
      <% if @my_gifts["received_gifts"].nil? || @my_gifts["received_gifts"].empty? %>
        <article class="twelve columns">
          <div class="four columns">
            <div class="gift-card empty"><span class="gc_icon"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="eight columns last">
            <p>Received gifts will appear here after you open them in your Gift Box Inventory.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      <% else %>
        <% @my_gifts["received_gifts"].each do | gift | %>
          <%# next if !gift["opened_by"] %>

          <article class="gift_block" id="gift-<%= gift['id'] %>">
            <div class="golden_gift_icon">
              <img src="<%= img_url('gifting/wintera/gift-bg-small.png') %>" class="small_icon" alt="golden gift box" />
              <span class="gc_icon"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="gg_about">
              <span class="detail_label">From:</span>
              <span class="details name"><%= gift["sender_name"] %></span>
              <span class="detail_label">Message:</span>
              <span class="details"><%= gift['message'] %></span>
            </div>
          </article>

        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    </section>
  <% end %>
</section>


<div id="gift-faq" class="reveal-modal">
    <h3 class="title-bar-dark">How Gifting Works</h3>
    <div class="inner_wrap">
      <h4>Here's how it works</h4>
      <ol>
        <li>Buy golden gift boxes in the 
          <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
          <a href="/tera/items/loot-boxes"><em><%= @game.upcase %></em> Store.</a>
        <% end %>
        <% if @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
          <a href="/closers/items"><em><%= @game.capitalize %></em> Store.</a>
        <% end %>
        <% if @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
          <a href="/kritika/items"><em>Kritika Online</em> Store.</a>
        <% end %>
        </li>
        <li>You can open a box yourself to find one of many fun prizes <br /><br />or</li>
        <li>You can give boxes to your friends and unlock special rewards, depending on how many gifts you give!</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Some restrictions apply. Please reference the <a href="http://support.enmasse.com/tera/2018-golden-gift-box-event">Golden Gift Box event FAQ</a> for more details and a full list of prizes.</p>
      <p class="text-align-center"><a href="#" class="close">Close this window</a></p>
    </div>
    <a class="close-reveal-modal">&#215;</a>
  </div>


<%# if (@game_accounts && !@game_accounts.empty? && @my_gifts && !@my_gifts[:error] && @game_servers["servers"] && !@game_servers["servers"].empty?) %>
<% if (@game_accounts && !@game_accounts.empty? && @my_gifts && !@my_gifts[:error]) %>
  <div id="send-gift" class="reveal-modal large" data-gameName="<%= @game %>">
    <h3 class="title-bar-dark reg_banner">Who should get this gift box?</h3>
    <h3 class="error_banner">Gift Box Send Error</h3>

    <ul class="selector">
      <li data-id="email" class="selected">
        <div class="inner"><span>Email Address</span></div>
      </li>
      <li data-id="charName">
        <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' %>
        <div class="inner"><span>Server &amp; Character Name</span></div>
        <% elsif @game.downcase == 'kritika' || @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
        <div class="inner"><span>World &amp; Character Name</span></div>
        <% else %>
        <div class="inner"><span>Character Name</span></div>
        <% end %>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="inner_wrap">
      <div id="email" style="display: block;">
        <div>
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter an email address">
          <a href="#" class="button-secondary validate">Validate</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="charName">
        <div>
          <% if @game.downcase == 'tera' && @game_servers["servers"] && !@game_servers["servers"].empty? %>
          <select name="server">
            <option selected="true">Server</option>
            <% @game_servers["servers"].each do |server| %>
              <option value="<%= server["id"] %>"><%= server["name"] %></option>
            <% end %>
          </select>
          <% end %>

          <% if @game.downcase == 'kritika' %>
          <select name="server">
            <option selected="true">World</option>
            <option value="na1">NA1</option>
            <option value="eu">EU</option>
          </select>
          <% end %>

          <% if @game.downcase == 'closers' %>
          <select name="server">
            <option selected="true">World</option>
            <option value="na">NA</option>
            <option value="eu">EU</option>
          </select>
          <% end %>

          <input type="text" name="character" placeholder="Character Name">
          <a href="#" class="button-secondary validate">Validate</a>
        </div>
        <div class="charInfo">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Race:</strong> <span class="race"></span></li>
            <li><strong>Class:</strong> <span class="class"></span></li>
            <li><strong>Level:</strong> <span class="level"></span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="name-check"></span>

      <div class="error-alert"><span class="icon"></span><span class="message">We could not find a user by that character name</span></div>
      <div class="messages">
        <h6>Optional Message:</h6>
        <div>
          <input type="text" name="to" placeholder="Enter a custom “To” name ">
          <span class="error to">Exceeds character limit.</span>
          <small class="to-count">0/30</small>
        </div>
        <div>
          <input type="text" name="from" placeholder="Enter a custom “From” name">
          <span class="error from">Exceeds character limit.</span>
          <small class="from-count">0/30</small>
        </div>
        <div>
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="Enter a custom message to send to the gift’s recipient "></textarea>
          <span class="error message">Exceeds character limit.</span>
          <small class="message-count">0/250</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#" class="close">Cancel</a> <a href="#" class="button-primary disabled">Send Gift</a>
      </div>
    </div>
      <a class="close-reveal-modal">&#215;</a>
  </div>

  <div id="gift-sent" class="reveal-modal" data-gameName="<%= @game %>">
    <h3 class="title-bar-dark">Gift Sent Successfully!</h3>
    <!--<div class="gift-card"></div>-->
    <p><span class="name"></span> should receive your gift shortly!</p>
    <!--<hr>-->
    <h3 class="text-align-center">Gifting Progress:</h3>
    <div id="gift-count" data-count="<%= @my_gifts["sent_count"].to_i %>"></div>
    <p class="text-align-center"><a href="#" class="close">Close this window</a></p>
    <a class="close-reveal-modal">&#215;</a>
  </div>

  <div id="gift-claim" class="reveal-modal" data-gameName="<%= @game %>">
    <h3 class="title-bar-dark reg_banner">Opening Gift Box</h3>
    <h3 class="error_banner">Opening Gift Box Error</h3>
    <div class="claim-open">
      <span class="mail-icon"></span>
      <div class="open_copy">
         <div class="error-alert"><span class="icon"></span><span class="message"></span></div>
        <h6><span>Gift Message: </span><span id="gift-claim-recipient"></span></h6>
        <p id="gift-claim-message"></p>
        <span class="gift_author">-- <span id="gift-claim-sender"></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="claim-copy">
      
      <h2 class="grats">You won <span class="prizeName"></span>.<br>Your new items will arrive in your Item Claim momentarily.</h2>
      <% if @game_accounts %>
        <% if @game_accounts.length > 1 %>
          <div class="account">
            <p>Game Account:</p>
            <select id="game-account" name="game_account_id">
              <% if @game_accounts.length > 1 %>
                  <option disabled="disabled" value="0" selected>Select an account</option>
              <% end %>
              <% @game_accounts.each do |ga| %>
                <% elite = ga["subscription_active"] %>
                <option value="<%= ga["id"] %>" data-elite="<%= elite %>"><%= ga["name"] %><%= ' (Elite)' if elite %></option>
              <% end %>
            </select>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <input type="hidden" id="game-account" value="<%= @game_accounts[0]["id"] %>">
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
      <h2 class="pick text-align-center">Pick a gift card:</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
      <div id="gifts-cover"></div>
      <% 4.times do %>
        <div class="gift">
          <div class="flipper">
            <div class="front"></div>
            <div class="back">
              <div class="prize"></div>
              <div class="title"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    
    <p class="text-align-center"><a href="#" class="close">Close window without picking a card</a></p>
    <a class="close-reveal-modal">&#215;</a>
  </div>
<% end %>
